            "value": "<p>It is a beautiful day here today &nbsp;All of Ladybird and Doc\u2019s babies have eyes open and are walking around on four legs like drunken sailors. They are actively playing tug of war and investigating their new world between sleeping and eating. We\u2019ve heard grunting, growling, groaning, and even howling already. Here\u2019s a few quick photos that I hope make you smile&nbsp;<\/p><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"5f7bb9f4-005b-4e23-a3e0-f5483b2b4a0a\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media><drupal-media data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"c43f8a2b-9178-40ce-bcae-4d19b9481be5\" data-align=\"center\">&nbsp;<\/drupal-media>",
